  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, exposing all controllable and uncontrollable events. The specification encodes a safe, coverage-biased exploration policy: move_forward or random_walk in clear, rotate or back out on obstacles, use full_rotate only after repeated blockages, and always return to forward progress as soon as possible. All uncontrollable events are total in every state. Recovery states are one-shot and do not self-loop on their controllable. Only one controllable is enabled per state.",
